1
00:01:36,979 --> 00:01:38,840
[The Lament of Autumn]

2
00:01:39,280 --> 00:01:41,770
[Episode 3]

3
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:52,930
Dad,

4
00:01:53,289 --> 00:01:54,870
I'll go prepare your medicine first.

5
00:01:54,870 --> 00:01:56,930
Please get some rest after taking it.

6
00:01:57,710 --> 00:01:59,479
Once you're feeling better,

7
00:02:00,200 --> 00:02:01,060
we'll find a way

8
00:02:01,310 --> 00:02:02,440
to leave this place.

9
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,040
Dad.

10
00:02:05,920 --> 00:02:06,480
Dad.

11
00:02:24,690 --> 00:02:26,620
When did you two start conspiring?

12
00:02:30,810 --> 00:02:32,670
I haven't conspired with anyone.

13
00:02:35,120 --> 00:02:36,740
You deliberately made that bet

14
00:02:36,740 --> 00:02:37,810
to stall for time.

15
00:02:38,500 --> 00:02:39,520
Where is Feng Yao,

16
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,740
the one you helped escape?

17
00:02:40,740 --> 00:02:42,270
What else are you planning?

18
00:02:42,620 --> 00:02:44,150
Who's pulling the strings?

19
00:02:46,470 --> 00:02:48,670
I don't know what you're talking about.

20
00:02:51,770 --> 00:02:55,370
You're familiar with these instruments
of torture, aren't you?

21
00:03:42,410 --> 00:03:43,940
Are you going to talk or not?

22
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:47,030
What do you want me to say?

23
00:03:47,810 --> 00:03:49,079
I don't know anything.

24
00:03:49,370 --> 00:03:51,079
Are you torturing me
to force a confession,

25
00:03:51,079 --> 00:03:53,740
expecting me to lie
and falsely accuse someone?

26
00:04:07,710 --> 00:04:09,710
That girl has had a hard life.

27
00:04:09,870 --> 00:04:11,020
It's just her

28
00:04:11,130 --> 00:04:12,240
and her seriously ill father at home.

29
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,960
They only have each other.

30
00:04:14,360 --> 00:04:15,690
My entire family of five

31
00:04:17,050 --> 00:04:19,260
was killed by Yu Changxuan.

32
00:04:19,690 --> 00:04:21,690
Even if it costs me my life,

33
00:04:22,190 --> 00:04:24,500
I'll make him pay in blood.

34
00:04:39,180 --> 00:04:40,120
Let's see

35
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,060
how long you can keep your mouth shut.

36
00:04:52,130 --> 00:04:52,680
Miss Ye,

37
00:04:54,300 --> 00:04:55,900
think of your mother at home.

38
00:04:56,070 --> 00:04:57,800
Why put yourself through this?

39
00:05:07,720 --> 00:05:09,270
I'll ask you one last time.

40
00:05:23,570 --> 00:05:26,570
Fifth Young Master Yu,
someone has turned herself in.

41
00:05:38,240 --> 00:05:39,220
Feng Yao.

42
00:05:52,250 --> 00:05:52,680
I never expected you

43
00:05:52,680 --> 00:05:54,250
to turn yourself in.

44
00:05:55,860 --> 00:05:57,510
I wanted to kill an evil man.

45
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,880
I've done nothing wrong.

46
00:06:00,810 --> 00:06:02,470
Why call it turning myself in?

47
00:06:03,360 --> 00:06:04,300
Even if I had

48
00:06:04,300 --> 00:06:06,220
only the slimmest chance,

49
00:06:07,950 --> 00:06:09,100
I'd still kill you.

50
00:06:09,860 --> 00:06:11,060
You hate me that much?

51
00:06:11,990 --> 00:06:13,920
What grudge do you have against me?

52
00:06:14,860 --> 00:06:15,720
My father

53
00:06:16,930 --> 00:06:18,930
spent his life practicing medicine

54
00:06:19,370 --> 00:06:20,720
and helping others.

55
00:06:21,300 --> 00:06:23,560
He often treated villagers for free.

56
00:06:24,270 --> 00:06:25,070
He was a good,

57
00:06:25,100 --> 00:06:27,070
law-abiding man.

58
00:06:27,540 --> 00:06:29,120
But because he failed to save

59
00:06:29,120 --> 00:06:30,770
a gravely wounded officer,

60
00:06:31,040 --> 00:06:33,600
your army ordered his execution

61
00:06:34,500 --> 00:06:35,830
and condemned my entire family

62
00:06:35,830 --> 00:06:36,890
to die with him.

63
00:06:37,159 --> 00:06:40,000
Now tell me, what grudge do you think
I have against you?

64
00:06:40,000 --> 00:06:41,200
The hatred between us

65
00:06:42,659 --> 00:06:44,060
can never be reconciled.

66
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:52,659
You've forgotten.

67
00:06:55,740 --> 00:06:57,310
You've forgotten all of it!

68
00:06:57,800 --> 00:07:00,560
You claim Fifth Young Master Yu
ordered your whole family killed.

69
00:07:00,560 --> 00:07:01,190
Then how did you

70
00:07:01,190 --> 00:07:02,590
and your father survive?

71
00:07:11,690 --> 00:07:13,180
Those soldiers

72
00:07:15,160 --> 00:07:17,560
abused me
for three whole days and nights.

73
00:07:19,100 --> 00:07:21,630
That's how I managed
to save my father's life.

74
00:07:23,390 --> 00:07:25,250
But his lung was pierced,

75
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:29,120
and he endured a living hell.

76
00:07:30,600 --> 00:07:31,600
Are you satisfied

77
00:07:33,770 --> 00:07:35,070
with that answer?

78
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,460
I never gave such an order.

79
00:07:37,720 --> 00:07:38,560
Shameless.

80
00:07:41,420 --> 00:07:42,390
You dare commit such atrocities

81
00:07:42,390 --> 00:07:43,970
but won't admit it?

82
00:07:44,300 --> 00:07:45,800
I read the newspaper.

83
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:48,390
You were on the front page,

84
00:07:48,750 --> 00:07:50,220
being honored

85
00:07:50,220 --> 00:07:52,550
for your service as a commanding officer.

86
00:07:52,659 --> 00:07:54,600
You were the one who gave the order.

87
00:08:01,120 --> 00:08:02,420
Fifth Young Master Yu

88
00:08:02,420 --> 00:08:04,070
could put a bullet in you right now.

89
00:08:04,070 --> 00:08:06,240
He has no reason
to waste his time lying to you.

90
00:08:06,240 --> 00:08:07,010
That unit

91
00:08:07,070 --> 00:08:09,310
wasn't
under Fifth Young Master Yu's command.

92
00:08:09,310 --> 00:08:10,450
The commander took credit

93
00:08:10,450 --> 00:08:11,790
for others' military achievements

94
00:08:11,790 --> 00:08:13,160
and passed them off

95
00:08:13,160 --> 00:08:14,690
as Fifth Young Master Yu's.

96
00:08:24,190 --> 00:08:25,000
Impossible.

97
00:08:25,660 --> 00:08:26,500
Impossible.

98
00:08:27,340 --> 00:08:28,360
Impossible!

99
00:08:29,300 --> 00:08:30,500
Impossible...

100
00:08:31,300 --> 00:08:32,289
Impossible...

101
00:08:42,460 --> 00:08:43,390
Here's the deal:

102
00:08:45,590 --> 00:08:47,250
tell me who's behind all this,

103
00:08:48,290 --> 00:08:49,530
and I might consider

104
00:08:50,100 --> 00:08:51,720
sparing you and your father.

105
00:08:58,010 --> 00:08:59,010
Feng Yao,

106
00:09:01,460 --> 00:09:03,320
just tell him what you know.

107
00:09:05,480 --> 00:09:07,010
You still have your father.

108
00:09:10,150 --> 00:09:11,500
Not anymore.

109
00:09:13,600 --> 00:09:14,570
Pingjun,

110
00:09:16,670 --> 00:09:18,270
it's too late.

111
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:22,510
My father...

112
00:09:25,220 --> 00:09:26,500
is already gone.

113
00:09:29,890 --> 00:09:30,700
Dad!

114
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:31,790
Dad.

115
00:09:31,840 --> 00:09:33,010
Dad, wake up.

116
00:09:33,550 --> 00:09:34,200
Dad!

117
00:09:34,530 --> 00:09:35,720
Dad, wake up.

118
00:09:36,050 --> 00:09:37,700
I... I got your medicine.

119
00:09:37,700 --> 00:09:38,390
The doctor said...

120
00:09:38,390 --> 00:09:39,720
The doctor said you'd get better
if you took your medicine.

121
00:09:39,720 --> 00:09:40,250
Dad,

122
00:09:40,290 --> 00:09:41,200
I'm getting your medicine.

123
00:09:41,200 --> 00:09:41,790
Dad.

124
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:43,720
The doctor said

125
00:09:43,720 --> 00:09:45,500
you'd get better once you took it.

126
00:09:45,500 --> 00:09:46,590
The doctor said...

127
00:09:46,890 --> 00:09:49,100
The doctor said you'd get better
if you took your medicine.

128
00:09:49,100 --> 00:09:49,720
Dad...

129
00:09:51,000 --> 00:09:51,790
Dad!

130
00:09:53,200 --> 00:09:54,790
I have no family

131
00:09:57,700 --> 00:09:59,340
left in this world.

132
00:10:18,340 --> 00:10:19,390
I came here

133
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:26,520
because I didn't want
to drag you into this.

134
00:10:46,970 --> 00:10:51,480
[Treating Men and Women of All Ages:
Internal and External Medicine]

135
00:11:31,610 --> 00:11:32,710
Thank you

136
00:11:34,630 --> 00:11:35,840
for letting me see

137
00:11:36,840 --> 00:11:38,300
my family together again,

138
00:11:42,030 --> 00:11:44,130
all in one place.

139
00:12:02,250 --> 00:12:03,010
Feng Yao!

140
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:08,460
Feng Yao.

141
00:12:08,740 --> 00:12:09,410
Feng Yao.

142
00:12:11,130 --> 00:12:12,960
I truly don't know

143
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:14,980
who's behind all this.

144
00:12:18,430 --> 00:12:19,330
I'm sorry,

145
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:23,630
Pingjun.

146
00:12:26,250 --> 00:12:27,960
I dragged you into this.

147
00:12:34,130 --> 00:12:35,630
At least

148
00:12:37,270 --> 00:12:38,980
I'll soon

149
00:12:39,740 --> 00:12:41,400
be free of all this suffering.

150
00:12:58,940 --> 00:12:59,740
Feng Yao.

151
00:13:20,510 --> 00:13:21,510
You may leave now.

152
00:13:55,600 --> 00:13:56,250
Get in.

153
00:14:07,240 --> 00:14:08,030
Get in,

154
00:14:09,790 --> 00:14:11,590
or go back to jail and stay there.

155
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:18,340
She was a living, breathing person,

156
00:14:20,170 --> 00:14:22,030
and she died right in front of you.

157
00:14:27,440 --> 00:14:29,040
She tried to assassinate me.

158
00:14:30,360 --> 00:14:32,690
She deserved to die
a thousand times over.

159
00:14:45,650 --> 00:14:46,290
The money.

160
00:14:55,820 --> 00:14:56,680
You won the bet,

161
00:14:57,820 --> 00:14:58,620
you saint.

162
00:15:12,630 --> 00:15:13,480
You bastard!

163
00:15:39,250 --> 00:15:41,580
Do you really want to get yourself killed?

164
00:15:47,790 --> 00:15:49,400
She nearly got you killed,

165
00:15:49,420 --> 00:15:51,280
and you're still taking her side.

166
00:15:58,100 --> 00:15:59,790
Don't you get it yet?

167
00:16:02,870 --> 00:16:03,720
I don't.

168
00:16:05,000 --> 00:16:05,800
Enlighten me.

169
00:16:13,210 --> 00:16:14,540
People like you

170
00:16:16,290 --> 00:16:18,340
are born above everyone else,

171
00:16:19,790 --> 00:16:20,770
looking down on ordinary people

172
00:16:20,770 --> 00:16:23,500
as if they're nothing
but ants beneath your feet.

173
00:16:24,840 --> 00:16:26,970
You don't understand their suffering

174
00:16:28,290 --> 00:16:29,860
or care about their pain.

175
00:16:29,880 --> 00:16:30,770
How could you ever understand

176
00:16:30,770 --> 00:16:33,770
why they're willing to risk their lives
to fight back?

177
00:16:50,000 --> 00:16:50,940
Don't forget,

178
00:16:51,360 --> 00:16:53,090
you can go home safely tonight,

179
00:16:54,600 --> 00:16:57,770
care for your mom and help her
get the medicine and treatment she needs,

180
00:16:57,770 --> 00:16:58,840
and go to school

181
00:16:59,770 --> 00:17:02,130
tomorrow morning,

182
00:17:03,670 --> 00:17:05,329
all because

183
00:17:05,500 --> 00:17:07,640
we protect this land.

184
00:17:10,589 --> 00:17:11,720
Without us,

185
00:17:12,750 --> 00:17:14,280
many more people would die.

186
00:17:23,329 --> 00:17:25,390
You oppress the people like a tyrant,

187
00:17:30,330 --> 00:17:33,260
yet you actually think
you're their guardian angel.

188
00:17:38,830 --> 00:17:40,720
We common folk

189
00:17:42,590 --> 00:17:44,330
are truly honored

190
00:17:47,590 --> 00:17:49,440
to have your protection.

191
00:18:27,530 --> 00:18:28,990
Now, that's interesting.

192
00:19:15,900 --> 00:19:16,700
Let me go!

193
00:19:17,070 --> 00:19:17,880
Let me go!

194
00:19:39,960 --> 00:19:40,750
Commander,

195
00:19:41,290 --> 00:19:43,030
I swear I didn't do it!

196
00:19:43,940 --> 00:19:44,420
He's

197
00:19:44,420 --> 00:19:45,920
an antique dealer.

198
00:19:46,050 --> 00:19:46,960
He said he had some valuable pieces

199
00:19:46,960 --> 00:19:48,360
he couldn't sell openly,

200
00:19:48,480 --> 00:19:49,250
so I met him

201
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:50,400
in private.

202
00:19:53,660 --> 00:19:55,160
Was it really just an antique deal?

203
00:19:55,160 --> 00:19:56,140
N-No!

204
00:19:56,140 --> 00:19:56,800
I'm just...

205
00:19:57,030 --> 00:19:57,830
I'm just a courier

206
00:19:57,830 --> 00:19:58,960
delivering bank drafts for cashing.

207
00:19:58,960 --> 00:19:59,940
Officer Liao said

208
00:19:59,940 --> 00:20:01,180
that any inside information

209
00:20:01,180 --> 00:20:02,000
comes at a price.

210
00:20:02,000 --> 00:20:03,170
You're crazy!

211
00:20:03,240 --> 00:20:04,900
Why are you framing me?

212
00:20:05,550 --> 00:20:06,410
Liao Dongfeng,

213
00:20:08,010 --> 00:20:09,410
how do you explain these?

214
00:20:09,740 --> 00:20:11,070
how do you explain them?

215
00:20:13,920 --> 00:20:16,030
Before the assassination attempt
on Fifth Young Master Yu,

216
00:20:16,030 --> 00:20:17,640
100,000 silver dollars were deposited

217
00:20:17,640 --> 00:20:18,810
into your bank account

218
00:20:18,810 --> 00:20:20,470
by someone from the Mu family.

219
00:20:20,920 --> 00:20:21,720
Commander,

220
00:20:22,200 --> 00:20:23,940
I had no idea!

221
00:20:25,000 --> 00:20:25,860
Liao Dongfeng,

222
00:20:27,140 --> 00:20:30,070
was my son's life
worth only 100,000 silver dollars?

223
00:20:30,900 --> 00:20:31,700
Commander,

224
00:20:32,550 --> 00:20:34,970
why won't you believe me?

225
00:20:35,330 --> 00:20:37,440
How could I possibly
kill Fifth Young Master Yu?

226
00:20:37,440 --> 00:20:40,350
I wouldn't dare!

227
00:20:44,610 --> 00:20:46,010
Commander...

228
00:20:47,610 --> 00:20:49,540
I'll take good care of your family.

229
00:20:52,110 --> 00:20:53,220
Go in peace.

230
00:20:54,070 --> 00:20:54,880
Commander...

231
00:20:57,420 --> 00:20:58,180
Commander!

232
00:20:59,030 --> 00:21:00,180
Commander!

233
00:21:00,640 --> 00:21:02,150
Commander!

234
00:21:02,310 --> 00:21:03,110
Commander...

235
00:21:03,480 --> 00:21:04,770
I'm innocent!

236
00:21:04,810 --> 00:21:07,740
Commander, save me!

237
00:21:08,220 --> 00:21:09,250
Commander!

238
00:21:10,920 --> 00:21:12,140
Commander...

239
00:21:12,220 --> 00:21:14,690
I'm innocent, Commander!

240
00:21:14,770 --> 00:21:17,160
Commander, save me!

241
00:21:30,850 --> 00:21:32,140
People like you

242
00:21:32,920 --> 00:21:35,060
are born above everyone else,

243
00:21:35,200 --> 00:21:36,270
looking down on ordinary people

244
00:21:36,270 --> 00:21:38,830
as if they're nothing
but ants beneath your feet.

245
00:21:38,830 --> 00:21:40,960
You don't understand their suffering

246
00:21:41,900 --> 00:21:43,290
or care about their pain.

247
00:21:43,290 --> 00:21:44,250
How could you ever understand

248
00:21:44,250 --> 00:21:47,250
why they're willing
to risk their lives to fight back?

249
00:21:53,350 --> 00:21:57,100
[Guanyin Pavilion]

250
00:21:57,420 --> 00:22:00,970
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

251
00:22:05,730 --> 00:22:09,870
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

252
00:22:21,460 --> 00:22:22,790
It's finally finished.

253
00:22:27,110 --> 00:22:28,140
Mingxuan,

254
00:22:28,500 --> 00:22:30,350
you've recreated

255
00:22:30,590 --> 00:22:31,500
so many architectural models

256
00:22:31,500 --> 00:22:32,830
based on ancient texts.

257
00:22:33,510 --> 00:22:35,610
When are you going to build a real one?

258
00:22:37,850 --> 00:22:38,900
Actually, this isn't what I most

259
00:22:38,900 --> 00:22:39,740
want to build.

260
00:22:39,960 --> 00:22:42,220
Then what do you want to build, Mingxuan?

261
00:22:43,570 --> 00:22:44,380
Changxuan,

262
00:22:45,350 --> 00:22:46,960
the peace we enjoy today

263
00:22:47,980 --> 00:22:50,110
is thanks to our family's protection.

264
00:22:50,740 --> 00:22:52,140
In these troubled times,

265
00:22:52,660 --> 00:22:53,920
the land is in turmoil,

266
00:22:54,320 --> 00:22:55,720
and the people are suffering.

267
00:22:55,720 --> 00:22:56,590
So many have

268
00:22:57,240 --> 00:22:58,980
no place to call home.

269
00:23:01,050 --> 00:23:01,740
We mustn't

270
00:23:01,740 --> 00:23:02,870
let our good fortune

271
00:23:03,880 --> 00:23:06,410
blind us to the suffering
of ordinary people.

272
00:23:07,330 --> 00:23:08,010
Remember,

273
00:23:09,180 --> 00:23:10,960
the most beautiful buildings

274
00:23:11,510 --> 00:23:14,050
are those that let people live
and work in peace

275
00:23:14,050 --> 00:23:15,110
and give them

276
00:23:15,850 --> 00:23:17,180
a lifetime of security.

277
00:23:21,680 --> 00:23:22,480
Yu Mingxuan,

278
00:23:25,250 --> 00:23:25,810
someone

279
00:23:25,810 --> 00:23:27,540
said the same thing to me today.

280
00:23:28,110 --> 00:23:29,290
She said

281
00:23:30,640 --> 00:23:33,640
I don't understand
the suffering of ordinary people,

282
00:23:36,110 --> 00:23:37,530
that I can't

283
00:23:37,530 --> 00:23:38,660
feel their pain.

284
00:23:49,110 --> 00:23:50,770
Of course I don't understand.

285
00:23:54,180 --> 00:23:56,110
You died before you could teach me.

286
00:23:56,660 --> 00:23:59,770
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

287
00:24:01,170 --> 00:24:04,030
All I've ever known
is what it means to be abandoned,

288
00:24:05,240 --> 00:24:08,240
to be treated
without a shred of affection or loyalty.

289
00:24:08,610 --> 00:24:09,640
So was I wrong?

290
00:24:11,180 --> 00:24:13,860
[Memorial Tablet of My Late Brother,
Yu Mingxuan]

291
00:24:23,380 --> 00:24:24,240
I wasn't wrong.

292
00:25:26,710 --> 00:25:27,690
Did I wake you?

293
00:25:28,440 --> 00:25:30,170
You're moving around too much.

294
00:25:30,400 --> 00:25:31,200
I can't sleep.

295
00:25:32,850 --> 00:25:34,110
I'll be gentler, then.

296
00:27:48,550 --> 00:27:49,350
Wanqiao,

297
00:27:51,030 --> 00:27:52,230
I've told you before:

298
00:27:54,830 --> 00:27:55,900
in this family,

299
00:27:57,240 --> 00:27:58,140
never overstep

300
00:27:59,640 --> 00:28:00,680
your bounds.

301
00:28:30,270 --> 00:28:33,160
[Minde Girls' High School]

302
00:28:38,270 --> 00:28:40,510
This letter comes a little late.

303
00:28:41,570 --> 00:28:44,250
I've picked up my pen several times,
only to put it down again.

304
00:28:44,250 --> 00:28:46,010
So much has happened lately.

305
00:28:46,700 --> 00:28:48,300
I hardly know where to begin.

306
00:28:49,440 --> 00:28:51,040
For the first time in my life,

307
00:28:51,500 --> 00:28:53,070
I've truly witnessed

308
00:28:53,070 --> 00:28:54,790
a life slipping away.

309
00:28:57,590 --> 00:28:58,400
Xueting,

310
00:28:59,600 --> 00:29:01,180
[Minde Girls' High School]

311
00:28:59,850 --> 00:29:01,110
how did the world

312
00:29:01,620 --> 00:29:02,080
[Minde Girls' High School]

313
00:29:01,830 --> 00:29:03,330
come to this?

314
00:29:07,260 --> 00:29:09,520
[Xiangxi Hotel]

315
00:29:28,830 --> 00:29:29,330
Hello, Master Jin.

316
00:29:29,330 --> 00:29:30,390
Hello, Master Jin.

317
00:29:32,310 --> 00:29:32,970
Master Jin.

318
00:29:34,440 --> 00:29:35,240
Master Jin.

319
00:29:37,460 --> 00:29:38,550
Good day, Master Jin.

320
00:29:38,550 --> 00:29:39,530
Good day, Master Jin.

321
00:29:39,530 --> 00:29:40,190
Master Jin.

322
00:29:42,110 --> 00:29:42,770
Master Jin.

323
00:29:43,570 --> 00:29:45,030
Mr. Wang, long time no see.

324
00:29:45,550 --> 00:29:47,270
I was in Guangzhou for a couple of days.

325
00:29:47,270 --> 00:29:48,250
As soon as I got back to Nanhuai,

326
00:29:48,250 --> 00:29:49,240
I came straight over

327
00:29:49,240 --> 00:29:50,460
to see you.

328
00:29:51,180 --> 00:29:52,380
Speaking of Guangzhou,

329
00:29:52,380 --> 00:29:53,140
we've got

330
00:29:53,160 --> 00:29:54,140
a new chef here

331
00:29:54,500 --> 00:29:56,240
who specializes in Cantonese cuisine.

332
00:29:56,240 --> 00:29:58,240
The new chef is great at making soup.

333
00:29:58,550 --> 00:29:59,680
You're a regular here,

334
00:29:59,680 --> 00:30:01,000
so do come by more often.

335
00:30:01,000 --> 00:30:02,440
Then I'll have to give it a try.

336
00:30:02,440 --> 00:30:03,720
All right, I'll let you get back to work.

337
00:30:03,720 --> 00:30:04,880
All right, I'd better get back to it.

338
00:30:04,880 --> 00:30:05,680
It's at the...

339
00:30:05,680 --> 00:30:06,740
Where was it again?

340
00:30:07,350 --> 00:30:08,050
Master Jin.

341
00:30:08,070 --> 00:30:09,660
-Long time no see.
-Master Jin.

342
00:30:09,660 --> 00:30:10,420
Sorry we haven't taken better care of you.

343
00:30:10,420 --> 00:30:11,010
Keep him company.

344
00:30:11,010 --> 00:30:11,610
All right.

345
00:30:11,960 --> 00:30:14,490
-Good day, Master Jin.
-Good day, Master Jin.

346
00:30:23,020 --> 00:30:24,420
All right, it's a deal.

347
00:30:31,330 --> 00:30:31,990
Changxuan.

348
00:30:32,530 --> 00:30:32,880
Following the clues

349
00:30:32,880 --> 00:30:34,080
Feng Yao left behind,

350
00:30:34,610 --> 00:30:36,590
we tracked down the accomplices
in the assassination attempt.

351
00:30:36,590 --> 00:30:38,390
They're all death-row convicts

352
00:30:40,680 --> 00:30:41,610
from Chihua.

353
00:30:45,220 --> 00:30:46,160
So

354
00:30:48,660 --> 00:30:50,250
Mu Linsen was behind it.

355
00:30:51,660 --> 00:30:53,060
There's something else.

356
00:30:53,500 --> 00:30:56,500
The Commander had Liao Dongfeng
executed last night.

357
00:31:06,300 --> 00:31:08,750
So the old man knew all along

358
00:31:09,810 --> 00:31:11,740
that Mu Linsen was the mastermind,

359
00:31:13,510 --> 00:31:15,010
and he personally buried

360
00:31:16,250 --> 00:31:17,960
the leads about the guns.

361
00:31:22,510 --> 00:31:24,310
The Commander wouldn't do that, surely.

362
00:31:24,310 --> 00:31:26,440
This concerns your safety, after all.

363
00:31:30,210 --> 00:31:31,360
If word gets out,

364
00:31:32,420 --> 00:31:34,950
the old generals opposed
to the allied forces

365
00:31:35,180 --> 00:31:37,110
will have even more reservations.

366
00:31:38,980 --> 00:31:40,310
To the old man,

367
00:31:40,660 --> 00:31:42,790
the allied forces come above all else.

368
00:31:43,460 --> 00:31:44,660
How could my safety

369
00:31:47,420 --> 00:31:49,280
get in the way of his rise to power?

370
00:32:02,160 --> 00:32:03,420
By the way, Changxuan,

371
00:32:04,160 --> 00:32:05,660
the men who killed Feng Yao's family

372
00:32:05,660 --> 00:32:06,900
were bandits recruited
by Brigade Commander Kuang

373
00:32:06,900 --> 00:32:07,980
three years ago.

374
00:32:09,110 --> 00:32:10,680
Does my brother-in-law know?

375
00:32:10,680 --> 00:32:11,250
Yes.

376
00:32:11,720 --> 00:32:13,310
When they were first recruited,

377
00:32:13,310 --> 00:32:14,940
Brigade Commander Kuang
spared them punishment

378
00:32:14,940 --> 00:32:16,400
to keep the troops in line.

379
00:32:18,350 --> 00:32:19,610
Those animals

380
00:32:20,850 --> 00:32:22,380
have no place in the Yu Army.

381
00:32:23,660 --> 00:32:26,660
Arrest them all
and deal with them under military law.

382
00:32:26,930 --> 00:32:27,690
Understood.

383
00:32:48,640 --> 00:32:49,310
Changxuan.

384
00:32:48,680 --> 00:32:52,290
[Vision and Wisdom Beyond Measure]

385
00:32:51,510 --> 00:32:52,810
You're finally back.

386
00:32:52,870 --> 00:32:54,400
I've been waiting for you for ages.

387
00:32:54,400 --> 00:32:55,960
What scheme are you cooking up this time?

388
00:32:55,960 --> 00:32:57,020
Nothing like that.

389
00:32:57,890 --> 00:32:59,900
I came all this way just to tell you

390
00:33:00,880 --> 00:33:01,590
Dad's back.

391
00:33:02,290 --> 00:33:03,550
Fifth Young Master Yu.

392
00:33:04,750 --> 00:33:05,740
Fifth Young Master Yu,

393
00:33:05,740 --> 00:33:08,270
the Commander is waiting for you
in his study.

394
00:33:20,590 --> 00:33:22,250
That brat Changxuan

395
00:33:22,510 --> 00:33:23,090
is back,

396
00:33:23,090 --> 00:33:25,220
yet I can't even catch a glimpse of him.

397
00:33:25,310 --> 00:33:26,070
You won't let him

398
00:33:26,070 --> 00:33:28,000
get involved in military affairs.

399
00:33:28,250 --> 00:33:30,350
No wonder he spends his days idle,

400
00:33:30,510 --> 00:33:32,700
looking for something to occupy his time.

401
00:33:32,700 --> 00:33:34,830
It's not as if I never gave him a chance.

402
00:33:35,110 --> 00:33:38,440
-Have you forgotten the trouble he caused?
-Didn't we agree

403
00:33:38,570 --> 00:33:40,070
not to bring up the past?

404
00:33:42,550 --> 00:33:43,680
Dad. Mom.

405
00:33:48,610 --> 00:33:51,270
Mind your manners
when you speak to your father.

406
00:33:58,010 --> 00:33:59,610
I called you here to tell you

407
00:34:00,050 --> 00:34:01,070
that the assassination case

408
00:34:01,070 --> 00:34:02,460
has been solved.

409
00:34:03,960 --> 00:34:05,770
Liao Dongfeng betrayed us,

410
00:34:06,460 --> 00:34:07,960
selling information

411
00:34:07,960 --> 00:34:09,320
to an old enemy I made

412
00:34:09,320 --> 00:34:11,449
while suppressing bandits years ago.

413
00:34:11,670 --> 00:34:13,130
I've dealt with him.

414
00:34:16,730 --> 00:34:17,880
I see.

415
00:34:23,380 --> 00:34:24,780
You've worked hard, Dad.

416
00:34:27,110 --> 00:34:28,170
All these years,

417
00:34:29,650 --> 00:34:31,460
I've never seen you

418
00:34:33,030 --> 00:34:35,030
take such an interest in my affairs.

419
00:34:35,760 --> 00:34:37,110
Are you insulting me

420
00:34:37,110 --> 00:34:38,230
or praising me?

421
00:34:41,380 --> 00:34:42,440
I'm touched.

422
00:34:46,230 --> 00:34:48,320
For the first time, I can see clearly

423
00:34:49,360 --> 00:34:51,159
that there's still a place for me

424
00:34:52,280 --> 00:34:53,440
in your heart.

425
00:35:01,280 --> 00:35:05,700
[Yu's Residence]

426
00:35:10,880 --> 00:35:11,680
One last bite.

427
00:35:18,550 --> 00:35:19,110
Mom,

428
00:35:19,320 --> 00:35:21,120
I think you look much better now.

429
00:35:21,150 --> 00:35:22,010
In a little while,

430
00:35:22,010 --> 00:35:24,210
I'll take you out to enjoy the sunshine.

431
00:35:24,880 --> 00:35:25,610
Okay.

432
00:35:26,280 --> 00:35:27,610
Whatever you say, dear.

433
00:35:28,820 --> 00:35:29,610
Pingjun!

434
00:35:31,110 --> 00:35:31,960
Pingjun!

435
00:35:32,670 --> 00:35:33,530
Hello, Auntie.

436
00:35:34,050 --> 00:35:35,010
Why are you here?

437
00:35:35,260 --> 00:35:37,060
To visit your mother, of course.

438
00:35:39,570 --> 00:35:40,420
Auntie.

439
00:35:42,780 --> 00:35:44,240
These flowers are for you.

440
00:35:45,030 --> 00:35:46,290
They're so beautiful.

441
00:35:46,820 --> 00:35:47,880
Thank you, Hanzhi.

442
00:35:48,900 --> 00:35:50,500
I'll get you a glass of water.

443
00:35:51,230 --> 00:35:51,900
Auntie,

444
00:35:52,320 --> 00:35:53,780
could I ask you for a favor?

445
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,150
Go ahead.

446
00:35:56,230 --> 00:35:58,290
Would you lend Pingjun to me for a day?

447
00:35:58,570 --> 00:35:59,630
My cousin is having

448
00:35:59,630 --> 00:36:00,860
an important family dinner today,

449
00:36:00,860 --> 00:36:02,480
and I need someone to accompany me.

450
00:36:02,480 --> 00:36:03,920
Please let Pingjun come along

451
00:36:03,920 --> 00:36:05,250
and have some fun, okay?

452
00:36:05,690 --> 00:36:06,320
Here.

453
00:36:07,070 --> 00:36:08,080
I can't do that.

454
00:36:08,110 --> 00:36:10,090
I have to stay and take care of my mom.

455
00:36:10,090 --> 00:36:11,150
Auntie...

456
00:36:13,150 --> 00:36:14,150
Just go.

457
00:36:14,840 --> 00:36:16,510
I'm feeling much better now.

458
00:36:16,960 --> 00:36:17,960
Besides,

459
00:36:18,460 --> 00:36:20,420
Hanzhi has asked so nicely.

460
00:36:20,650 --> 00:36:21,780
You wouldn't want to

461
00:36:22,090 --> 00:36:24,750
turn her down
and make her feel slighted, right?

462
00:36:28,110 --> 00:36:29,510
Just come with me.

463
00:36:29,840 --> 00:36:31,840
My cousin will send someone to pick us up.

464
00:36:31,840 --> 00:36:33,130
We'll be driven there and back.

465
00:36:33,130 --> 00:36:34,510
It won't take much time.

466
00:36:35,170 --> 00:36:36,360
Just go with her.

467
00:36:36,840 --> 00:36:37,960
I'm really fine.

468
00:36:42,570 --> 00:36:43,430
Alright, then.

469
00:36:47,010 --> 00:36:47,880
Cousin.

470
00:36:48,500 --> 00:36:49,650
Mission accomplished.

471
00:36:49,650 --> 00:36:50,980
I've brought her to you.

472
00:36:52,550 --> 00:36:54,500
This is my classmate, Pingjun.

473
00:36:54,960 --> 00:36:55,670
I

474
00:36:55,670 --> 00:36:56,130
don't know

475
00:36:56,130 --> 00:36:57,320
what got into him yesterday,

476
00:36:57,320 --> 00:36:58,840
but he insisted that none of my classmates

477
00:36:58,840 --> 00:37:00,780
could compare to the socialites he knows.

478
00:37:00,780 --> 00:37:02,880
I was so annoyed
that I mentioned you to him.

479
00:37:02,880 --> 00:37:04,130
Did I say that?

480
00:37:05,650 --> 00:37:07,150
Nice to meet you, Miss Ye.

481
00:37:08,880 --> 00:37:09,360
Bowen.

482
00:37:09,550 --> 00:37:10,010
Come on.

483
00:37:11,150 --> 00:37:12,010
Excuse me.

484
00:37:13,000 --> 00:37:13,510
Miss Ye,

485
00:37:13,610 --> 00:37:14,630
let me introduce you.

486
00:37:14,630 --> 00:37:15,920
This is my older sister,

487
00:37:15,920 --> 00:37:17,440
Li Bowen.

488
00:37:18,550 --> 00:37:19,680
Pleased to meet you.

489
00:37:20,050 --> 00:37:21,850
You're even lovelier in person.

490
00:37:21,960 --> 00:37:22,850
Miss Ye,

491
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:25,610
you're truly a beauty
of grace and refinement.

492
00:37:25,610 --> 00:37:27,210
You've completely outshone

493
00:37:27,210 --> 00:37:28,400
our Hanzhi.

494
00:37:28,480 --> 00:37:29,460
You flatter me.

495
00:37:30,150 --> 00:37:31,920
Bowen, please keep them company for a bit.

496
00:37:31,920 --> 00:37:33,130
I need to go get things ready.

497
00:37:33,130 --> 00:37:33,630
Excuse me.

498
00:37:33,630 --> 00:37:34,510
Go ahead.

499
00:37:34,710 --> 00:37:35,910
I'll take them over.

500
00:37:36,280 --> 00:37:36,910
Let's go.

501
00:37:36,980 --> 00:37:37,610
Miss Ye.

502
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:39,780
Let's take our seats.

503
00:37:41,010 --> 00:37:42,190
Come on, Miss Ye.

504
00:37:43,880 --> 00:37:44,610
-Thank you.
-This way, please.

505
00:37:44,610 --> 00:37:45,150
Please.

506
00:37:49,760 --> 00:37:50,880
Come on, Miss Ye.

507
00:37:51,090 --> 00:37:52,150
Please have a seat.

508
00:37:57,150 --> 00:37:58,420
Miss Ye, have a seat.

509
00:38:01,010 --> 00:38:02,260
I'm sorry, Bowen.

510
00:38:02,460 --> 00:38:03,650
I just remembered

511
00:38:03,650 --> 00:38:05,900
that I have to take my mother
to the hospital for a checkup.

512
00:38:05,900 --> 00:38:07,110
So I can't stay for the meal.

513
00:38:07,110 --> 00:38:08,630
Would you like me to go with you?

514
00:38:08,630 --> 00:38:09,110
No need.

515
00:38:09,110 --> 00:38:09,860
Wait.

516
00:38:11,050 --> 00:38:11,820
What?

517
00:38:12,360 --> 00:38:13,560
The moment you see me,

518
00:38:13,630 --> 00:38:15,510
you scramble to leave?

519
00:38:16,360 --> 00:38:17,960
Am I some kind of monster?

520
00:38:19,880 --> 00:38:20,550
That's not

521
00:38:20,620 --> 00:38:22,260
how we treat guests in my home.

522
00:38:22,260 --> 00:38:23,050
Miss Ye,

523
00:38:23,170 --> 00:38:25,510
at least have something to eat
before you go.

524
00:38:25,510 --> 00:38:26,500
-Yeah.
-You know

525
00:38:26,820 --> 00:38:27,940
how difficult it is to get an appointment

526
00:38:27,940 --> 00:38:29,010
at a major hospital.

527
00:38:29,010 --> 00:38:30,150
If we miss it this time,

528
00:38:30,150 --> 00:38:32,010
who knows when we'll get another.

529
00:38:32,610 --> 00:38:33,460
That's easy.

530
00:38:34,420 --> 00:38:36,550
I'll have Director Gu
send someone to the hospital.

531
00:38:36,550 --> 00:38:38,170
With his men standing guard at the door,

532
00:38:38,170 --> 00:38:40,050
the doctor will be sure
to give your mother

533
00:38:40,050 --> 00:38:41,450
a thorough examination.

534
00:38:42,280 --> 00:38:43,960
There's no need for such a fuss.

535
00:38:43,960 --> 00:38:45,510
After the meal,

536
00:38:45,510 --> 00:38:47,110
I'll have a car take you home,

537
00:38:47,150 --> 00:38:48,150
pick up your mother,

538
00:38:48,150 --> 00:38:49,360
and then take you both to the hospital.

539
00:38:49,360 --> 00:38:50,860
You won't miss the appointment,

540
00:38:50,860 --> 00:38:52,190
so just relax and stay.

541
00:38:53,420 --> 00:38:54,780
-Come on, have a seat.
-Come on.

542
00:38:54,780 --> 00:38:55,130
Sit down.

543
00:38:55,130 --> 00:38:56,010
-Come on. Have a seat.
-Hanzhi.

544
00:38:56,010 --> 00:38:56,800
Come on, sit.

545
00:38:57,760 --> 00:38:58,420
Please sit.

546
00:38:58,960 --> 00:39:00,490
Let's enjoy the meal first.

547
00:39:00,610 --> 00:39:02,470
Yeah, since you're already here.

548
00:39:06,050 --> 00:39:07,710
Since everyone is here today,

549
00:39:08,030 --> 00:39:09,110
I have an important announcement

550
00:39:09,110 --> 00:39:09,690
to make.

551
00:39:12,860 --> 00:39:13,710
Miss Ye,

552
00:39:14,260 --> 00:39:15,720
the moment I saw you today,

553
00:39:16,000 --> 00:39:17,730
I took an instant liking to you.

554
00:39:17,960 --> 00:39:18,860
I thought to myself,

555
00:39:18,860 --> 00:39:20,860
how wonderful it would be if I could

556
00:39:20,980 --> 00:39:22,510
take you as my sworn sister.

557
00:39:22,760 --> 00:39:23,550
I wonder

558
00:39:23,650 --> 00:39:25,380
if you would do me the honor

559
00:39:25,460 --> 00:39:28,280
of accepting me as your older sister.

560
00:39:28,510 --> 00:39:29,440
Would you agree?

561
00:39:30,780 --> 00:39:32,850
I didn't expect Miss Ye and Bowen

562
00:39:32,960 --> 00:39:34,210
to hit it off so well.

563
00:39:35,280 --> 00:39:37,530
How could I possibly be worthy of
such an honor?

564
00:39:37,530 --> 00:39:39,050
Not at all, not at all.

565
00:39:40,860 --> 00:39:41,530
Sister,

566
00:39:42,010 --> 00:39:43,590
here's a small gift
to mark our first meeting.

567
00:39:43,590 --> 00:39:44,590
Please accept it.

568
00:39:47,780 --> 00:39:49,840
Bowen, that's quite a generous gift.

569
00:39:50,760 --> 00:39:52,660
Miss Ye is truly lucky!

570
00:39:52,680 --> 00:39:54,170
-Yes, she is.
-Alright.

571
00:39:54,530 --> 00:39:55,860
From today on,

572
00:39:56,150 --> 00:39:56,840
Pingjun

573
00:39:57,090 --> 00:39:59,350
is the little sister of both Boren and me.

574
00:39:59,730 --> 00:40:02,570
If any of you dare to bully her,

575
00:40:03,420 --> 00:40:05,480
I will never let them get away with it.

576
00:40:06,110 --> 00:40:07,920
Since she's your sworn sister now,

577
00:40:07,920 --> 00:40:09,130
we can't cherish her enough.

578
00:40:09,130 --> 00:40:10,690
How could we have the heart to bully her?

579
00:40:10,690 --> 00:40:11,280
Good.

580
00:40:12,260 --> 00:40:13,820
In that case,

581
00:40:14,150 --> 00:40:15,460
if you think you can
dote on my little sister

582
00:40:15,460 --> 00:40:16,280
without first treating

583
00:40:16,280 --> 00:40:18,140
Bowen and me to winter melon soup,

584
00:40:18,150 --> 00:40:19,090
you've got

585
00:40:19,090 --> 00:40:20,350
another thing coming.

586
00:40:20,460 --> 00:40:21,260
Cousin,

587
00:40:21,430 --> 00:40:23,110
you haven't had a drop, and you're
already talking like you're drunk.

588
00:40:23,110 --> 00:40:24,260
Isn't winter melon soup

589
00:40:24,260 --> 00:40:24,670
for thanking

590
00:40:24,670 --> 00:40:25,630
the matchmaker?

591
00:40:26,150 --> 00:40:26,980
Is that so?

592
00:40:33,500 --> 00:40:34,320
Pingjun,

593
00:40:35,280 --> 00:40:36,080
a toast to you.

594
00:40:55,460 --> 00:40:56,920
Why just an ordinary toast?

595
00:40:56,920 --> 00:40:58,510
Link arms and drink like newlyweds!

596
00:40:58,510 --> 00:40:59,260
Exactly!

597
00:40:59,260 --> 00:41:00,390
Link arms and drink!

598
00:41:00,400 --> 00:41:01,360
Come on, link arms and drink!

599
00:41:01,360 --> 00:41:02,420
Stop teasing them!

600
00:41:05,460 --> 00:41:07,030
When you offer a toast, Brother,

601
00:41:07,030 --> 00:41:08,630
how could I possibly refuse?

602
00:41:11,510 --> 00:41:12,710
What did you just call me?

603
00:41:12,710 --> 00:41:14,110
Brother, of course.

604
00:41:15,010 --> 00:41:17,030
I'm the Li family's newly sworn sister.

605
00:41:17,030 --> 00:41:18,320
And since you and Mr. Li

606
00:41:18,320 --> 00:41:19,720
are as close as brothers,

607
00:41:20,050 --> 00:41:21,390
calling you "Brother"

608
00:41:21,920 --> 00:41:23,250
is only right, isn't it?

609
00:41:40,170 --> 00:41:41,230
Sorry, everyone.

610
00:41:41,440 --> 00:41:42,860
I really have something
to take care of today.

611
00:41:42,860 --> 00:41:43,990
I'll head out first.

612
00:41:44,460 --> 00:41:45,460
I'm leaving too.

613
00:41:47,650 --> 00:41:50,450
I'm going that way anyway,
so let me give you a ride.

614
00:41:54,780 --> 00:41:55,510
Let's go,

615
00:41:56,230 --> 00:41:57,050
Sister.

616
00:42:28,480 --> 00:42:30,340
This gold bracelet is a bit gaudy.

617
00:42:30,780 --> 00:42:32,190
It doesn't suit

618
00:42:32,480 --> 00:42:34,340
hands as lovely as yours, Sister.

619
00:42:36,110 --> 00:42:36,920
There were so many people today,

620
00:42:36,920 --> 00:42:38,120
so I couldn't refuse.

621
00:42:38,690 --> 00:42:39,510
I'll return it

622
00:42:40,000 --> 00:42:41,730
to Bowen the next time I see her.

623
00:42:42,630 --> 00:42:43,160
Ruitong,

624
00:42:44,130 --> 00:42:47,060
bring me the brocade box
from the glove compartment.

625
00:42:52,800 --> 00:42:53,840
It's good that you're returning it.

626
00:42:53,840 --> 00:42:54,510
Wear mine.

627
00:42:57,070 --> 00:42:59,130
Don't try to take it off. It's for you.

628
00:42:59,260 --> 00:43:00,120
I don't want it.

629
00:43:00,400 --> 00:43:01,070
What?

630
00:43:01,510 --> 00:43:02,110
Is the bracelet

631
00:43:02,110 --> 00:43:04,170
going to bite your hand or something?

632
00:43:14,550 --> 00:43:15,710
I'm sorry, Fifth Young Master.

633
00:43:15,710 --> 00:43:16,340
I'm sorry.

634
00:43:30,300 --> 00:43:31,000
If you

635
00:43:31,000 --> 00:43:32,780
really want to give me something,

636
00:43:32,780 --> 00:43:34,070
why not give me the contract

637
00:43:34,070 --> 00:43:35,170
for the Xiangxi Hotel instead?

638
00:43:35,170 --> 00:43:35,960
Since you already know

639
00:43:35,960 --> 00:43:36,670
the assassination

640
00:43:36,670 --> 00:43:38,070
had nothing to do with me,

641
00:43:38,360 --> 00:43:39,320
our agreement

642
00:43:39,690 --> 00:43:41,620
can be terminated automatically.

643
00:43:41,670 --> 00:43:44,000
It's not that I don't want to
give it to you.

644
00:43:47,000 --> 00:43:48,130
I just can't bear to.

645
00:43:49,300 --> 00:43:50,230
What do you mean?

646
00:43:54,070 --> 00:43:55,630
I find a woman like you

647
00:43:56,170 --> 00:43:57,500
genuinely intriguing.

648
00:43:58,570 --> 00:44:00,100
I've grown a bit fond of you.

649
00:44:03,630 --> 00:44:04,890
Fifth Young Master Yu,

650
00:44:04,980 --> 00:44:06,640
do you think I'd believe that?

651
00:44:09,300 --> 00:44:10,210
Just a moment ago,

652
00:44:10,210 --> 00:44:11,940
you were calling me "Brother,"

653
00:44:12,280 --> 00:44:14,680
and now
it's "Fifth Young Master Yu" again.

654
00:44:14,940 --> 00:44:16,200
But it doesn't matter.

655
00:44:16,630 --> 00:44:17,830
Whatever you call me,

656
00:44:18,170 --> 00:44:19,300
I'm happy to hear it.

657
00:44:21,440 --> 00:44:22,340
Li Boren

658
00:44:22,380 --> 00:44:23,610
deliberately goaded Hanzhi

659
00:44:23,610 --> 00:44:24,760
into bringing me.

660
00:44:24,940 --> 00:44:27,070
Then Bowen took me as her sworn sister.

661
00:44:27,440 --> 00:44:29,170
And you, Fifth Young Master Yu,

662
00:44:29,300 --> 00:44:31,960
gave me a bracelet
and declared your affection.

663
00:44:32,150 --> 00:44:33,550
What are you really up to?

664
00:44:34,980 --> 00:44:36,040
I already told you.

665
00:44:37,280 --> 00:44:38,230
I like you.

666
00:44:39,980 --> 00:44:41,040
I want to court you.

667
00:44:47,980 --> 00:44:49,180
My home is just ahead.

668
00:44:51,630 --> 00:44:53,960
I won't trouble you
to take me any further.

669
00:45:09,110 --> 00:45:10,240
Fifth Young Master,

670
00:45:10,590 --> 00:45:10,940
she's just a girl

671
00:45:10,940 --> 00:45:12,280
from a humble family.

672
00:45:12,690 --> 00:45:13,920
I'm sure Second Young Lady Tao

673
00:45:13,920 --> 00:45:15,380
won't take her seriously.

674
00:45:17,420 --> 00:45:18,550
I actually think...

675
00:45:20,400 --> 00:45:21,400
she's quite clever.
